{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Brittle","html":"<article id='sn22.32'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.32 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 22.32 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>3. Bhāravagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>3. The Burden </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Pabhaṅgusutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Brittle </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>Sāvatthinidānaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>At Sāvatthī. </span></p>\n<p><span class='root'>“Pabhaṅguñca, bhikkhave, desessāmi appabhaṅguñca. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Mendicants, I will teach you what is brittle and what is not brittle. </span>\n<span class='root'>Taṁ suṇātha. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Listen … </span></p>\n<p><span class='root'>Kiñca, bhikkhave, pabhaṅgu, kiṁ appabhaṅgu? </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>And what is brittle? What is not brittle? </span>\n<span class='root'>Rūpaṁ, bhikkhave, pabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Form is brittle, </span>\n<span class='root'>Yo tassa nirodho vūpasamo atthaṅgamo, idaṁ appabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>but its cessation, settling, and disappearance is not brittle. </span></p>\n<p><span class='root'>Vedanā pabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Feeling … </span>\n<span class='root'>Yo tassā nirodho vūpasamo atthaṅgamo, idaṁ appabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span>\n<span class='root'>Saññā pabhaṅgu … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>perception … </span>\n<span class='root'>saṅkhārā pabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>choices … </span>\n<span class='root'>Yo tesaṁ nirodho vūpasamo atthaṅgamo, idaṁ appabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span>\n<span class='root'>Viññāṇaṁ pabhaṅgu. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>consciousness is brittle, </span>\n<span class='root'>Yo tassa nirodho vūpasamo atthaṅgamo, idaṁ appabhaṅgū”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>but its cessation, settling, and disappearance is not brittle.” </span></p>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Ekādasamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Bhāravaggo tatiyo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Bhāraṁ pariññaṁ abhijānaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>chandarāgaṁ catutthakaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Assādā ca tayo vuttā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>abhinandanamaṭṭhamaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Uppādaṁ aghamūlañca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ekādasamo pabhaṅgūti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
